#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for an Empire ware: Granite, part 2
#: ../../../../data/tribes/initialization/empire/units.lua:113
msgctxt "empire_ware"
msgid "The Empire produces granite blocks in quarries and marble mines."
msgstr "O Império produz blocos de granito em pedreiras e minas de mármore."

#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for an Empire ware: Log, part 2
#: ../../../../data/tribes/initialization/empire/units.lua:125
msgctxt "empire_ware"
msgid ""
"Imperial lumberjacks fell the trees; foresters take care of the supply of "
"trees. Logs are also used by the charcoal kiln, the toolsmithy and the "
"sawmill."
msgstr "Os lenhadores imperiais derrubam as árvores; os silvicultores cuidam do suprimento de árvores. As toras também são usadas pela casa do carvoeiro, pela ferraria de ferramentas e pela serraria."

#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for an Empire ware: Planks, part 2
#: ../../../../data/tribes/initialization/empire/units.lua:138
msgctxt "empire_ware"
msgid "They are produced out of logs by the sawmill."
msgstr "Elas são produzidas a partir de toras pela serraria."

#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for an Empire ware: Planks, part 3
#: ../../../../data/tribes/initialization/empire/units.lua:140
msgctxt "empire_ware"
msgid "They are also used by the weapon smithy."
msgstr "Elas também são usadas pela ferraria de armas."

#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for an Empire ware: Wool
#: ../../../../data/tribes/initialization/empire/units.lua:150
msgctxt "empire_ware"
msgid "Wool is the hair of sheep. Weaving mills use it to make cloth."
msgstr "A lã é o pelo das ovelhas. Tecelagens a usam para fazer tecido."

#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for an Empire ware: Cloth
#: ../../../../data/tribes/initialization/empire/units.lua:159
msgctxt "empire_ware"
msgid ""
"Cloth is needed to build several buildings. It is also consumed in the armor"
" smithy."
msgstr "O tecido é necessário para construir várias construções. Também é consumido na ferraria de armaduras."

#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for an Empire ware: Fish
#: ../../../../data/tribes/initialization/empire/units.lua:170
msgctxt "empire_ware"
msgid ""
"Besides bread and meat, fish is also a foodstuff for the Empire. Fish are "
"used in taverns, inns and training sites (arena, colosseum, training camp)."
msgstr "Além de pão e carne, peixe também é um alimento para o Império. Peixes são usados em tabernas, estalagens e locais de treinamento (arena, coliseu, acampamento de treinamento)."

#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for an Empire ware: Meat, part 2
#: ../../../../data/tribes/initialization/empire/units.lua:182
msgctxt "empire_ware"
msgid ""
"Meat can also be obtained as pork from piggeries. It is used in the inns and"
" taverns to prepare lunch for the miners and is consumed at the training "
"sites (arena, colosseum, training camp)."
msgstr "A carne também pode ser obtida como carne suína de pocilgas. É usada nas estalagens e tabernas para preparar o almoço dos mineradores e é consumida nos locais de treinamento (arena, coliseu, acampamento de treinamento)."

#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for an Empire ware: Water, part 2
#: ../../../../data/tribes/initialization/empire/units.lua:194
msgctxt "empire_ware"
msgid ""
"Water is used in the bakery and the brewery. The donkey farm, the sheep farm"
" and the piggery also need to be supplied with water."
msgstr "A água é usada na padaria e na cervejaria. A fazenda de jumentos, a fazenda de ovelhas e a pocilga também precisam ser abastecidas com água."

#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for an Empire ware: Wheat, part 2
#: ../../../../data/tribes/initialization/empire/units.lua:206
msgctxt "empire_ware"
msgid ""
"Wheat is produced by farms and used by mills and breweries. Donkey farms, "
"sheep farms and piggeries also need to be supplied with wheat."
msgstr "O trigo é produzido por fazendas e usado por moinhos e cervejarias. Fazendas de jumentos, fazendas de ovelhas e pocilgas também precisam ser abastecidas com trigo."

#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for an Empire ware: Flour
#: ../../../../data/tribes/initialization/empire/units.lua:216
msgctxt "empire_ware"
msgid ""
"Flour is produced by the mill out of wheat and is needed in the bakery to "
"produce the tasty Empire bread."
msgstr "Farinha de Raízes Escuras é produzida no moinho através das Raízes Escuras. É utilizada pelos padeiros para fazer deliciosos pães."

#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for an Empire ware: Bread
#: ../../../../data/tribes/initialization/empire/units.lua:225
msgctxt "empire_ware"
msgid ""
"The bakers of the Empire make really tasty bread out of flour and water. It "
"is used in taverns and inns to prepare rations and meals. Bread is also "
"consumed at the training sites (arena, colosseum, training camp)."
msgstr "Os padeiros do Império fazem um pão realmente saboroso de farinha e água. Ele é usado em tabernas e estalagens para preparar rações e refeições. O pão também é consumido nos locais de treinamento (arena, coliseu, acampamento de treinamento)."

#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for an Empire ware: Beer
#: ../../../../data/tribes/initialization/empire/units.lua:234
msgctxt "empire_ware"
msgid ""
"This beer is produced in a brewery out of wheat and water. It is consumed by"
" miners in coal and iron mines."
msgstr "Esta cerveja é produzida em uma cervejaria a partir de trigo e água. É consumida por mineradores nas minas de carvão e ferro."

#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for an Empire ware: Grape
#: ../../../../data/tribes/initialization/empire/units.lua:242
msgctxt "empire_ware"
msgid ""
"These grapes are the base for a tasty wine. They are harvested in a vineyard"
" and processed in a winery."
msgstr "Estas uvas são a base para um vinho saboroso. Elas são colhidas em um vinhedo e processadas em uma vinícola."

#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for an Empire ware: Wine
#: ../../../../data/tribes/initialization/empire/units.lua:250
msgctxt "empire_ware"
msgid ""
"This tasty wine is drunk by the miners working the marble and gold mines. It"
" is produced in a winery."
msgstr "Este vinho saboroso é bebido pelos mineradores que trabalham nas minas de mármore e ouro. É produzido em uma vinícola."

#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for an Empire ware: Ration, part 2
#: ../../../../data/tribes/initialization/empire/units.lua:262
msgctxt "empire_ware"
msgid "Rations are produced in a tavern out of fish or meat or bread."
msgstr "As rações são produzidas em uma taberna a partir de peixe, carne ou pão."

#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for an Empire ware: Meal
#: ../../../../data/tribes/initialization/empire/units.lua:272
msgctxt "empire_ware"
msgid ""
"A real meal is made in inns out of bread and fish/meat. It satisfies the "
"needs of miners in deep mines."
msgstr "Uma refeição de verdade é feita em estalagens a partir de pão e peixe/carne. Ela satisfaz as necessidades dos mineradores em minas profundas."

#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for an Empire ware: Marble
#: ../../../../data/tribes/initialization/empire/units.lua:284
msgctxt "empire_ware"
msgid ""
"Marble is the beautiful stone which is cut out of the mountains or produced "
"in a quarry. Marble is used as a building material and gets chiseled into "
"marble columns in the stonemason’s house."
msgstr "Mármore é a bela pedra extraída das montanhas ou produzida em uma pedreira. O mármore é usado como material de construção e é cinzelado em colunas de mármore na casa do pedreiro."

#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for an Empire ware: Marble Column
#: ../../../../data/tribes/initialization/empire/units.lua:293
msgctxt "empire_ware"
msgid ""
"Marble columns represent the high culture of the Empire, so they are needed "
"for nearly every larger building. They are produced out of marble at a "
"stonemason’s house."
msgstr "As colunas de mármore representam a alta cultura do Império, então são necessárias para quase toda construção maior. Elas são produzidas a partir de mármore na casa do pedreiro."

#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for an Empire ware: Coal, part 2
#: ../../../../data/tribes/initialization/empire/units.lua:305
msgctxt "empire_ware"
msgid ""
"The fires of the Empire smelting works, armor smithies and weapon smithies "
"are usually fed with coal."
msgstr "Os fogos das fundições, ferrarias de armaduras e ferrarias de armas do Império geralmente são alimentados com carvão."

#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for an Empire ware: Iron Ore, part 2
#: ../../../../data/tribes/initialization/empire/units.lua:318
msgctxt "empire_ware"
msgid "It is smelted in a smelting works to retrieve the iron."
msgstr "Ele é fundido em uma fundição para obter o ferro."

#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for an Empire ware: Iron, part 2
#: ../../../../data/tribes/initialization/empire/units.lua:331
msgctxt "empire_ware"
msgid ""
"It is produced by the smelting works. Weapons, armor and tools are made of "
"iron."
msgstr "Ele é produzido pela fundição. Armas, armaduras e ferramentas são feitas de ferro."

#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for an Empire ware: Gold Ore, part 2
#: ../../../../data/tribes/initialization/empire/units.lua:344
msgctxt "empire_ware"
msgid ""
"Smelted in a smelting works, it turns into gold which is used as a precious "
"building material and to produce weapons and armor."
msgstr "Fundido em uma fundição, ele se transforma em ouro, que é usado como um precioso material de construção e para produzir armas e armaduras."

#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for an Empire ware: Gold, part 2
#: ../../../../data/tribes/initialization/empire/units.lua:357
msgctxt "empire_ware"
msgid ""
"It is produced by the smelting works. Armor and weapons are embellished with"
" gold in the armor smithy and the weapon smithy."
msgstr "Ele é produzido pela fundição. Armaduras e armas são embelezadas com ouro na ferraria de armaduras e na ferraria de armas."

#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for an Empire ware: Pick
#: ../../../../data/tribes/initialization/empire/units.lua:370
msgctxt "empire_ware"
msgid ""
"Picks are used by stonemasons and miners. They are produced by the "
"toolsmith."
msgstr "Picaretas são usadas por pedreiros e mineradores. Elas são produzidas pelo ferramenteiro."

#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for an Empire ware: Felling Ax, part 2
#: ../../../../data/tribes/initialization/empire/units.lua:382
msgctxt "empire_ware"
msgid "Felling axes are used by lumberjacks and produced by the toolsmithy."
msgstr "Machados de corte são usados por lenhadores e produzidos pela ferraria de ferramentas."

#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for an Empire ware: Saw
#: ../../../../data/tribes/initialization/empire/units.lua:392
msgctxt "empire_ware"
msgid "This saw is needed by the carpenter. It is produced by the toolsmith."
msgstr "Esta serra é necessária ao carpinteiro. Ela é produzida pelo ferramenteiro."

#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for an Empire ware: Shovel, part 2
#: ../../../../data/tribes/initialization/empire/units.lua:404
msgctxt "empire_ware"
msgid ""
"Therefore the forester and the vine farmer use them. They are produced by "
"the toolsmith."
msgstr "Por isso o silvicultor e o cultivador de vinhas as usam. Elas são produzidas pelo ferramenteiro."

#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for an Empire ware: Hammer, part 2
#: ../../../../data/tribes/initialization/empire/units.lua:417
msgctxt "empire_ware"
msgid ""
"Geologists, builders, weaponsmiths, armorsmiths and shipwrights all need a "
"hammer. Make sure you’ve always got some in reserve! They are produced by "
"the toolsmith."
msgstr "Geólogos, construtores, ferreiros de armas, ferreiros de armaduras e construtores navais todos precisam de um martelo. Certifique-se de sempre ter alguns em reserva! Eles são produzidos pelo ferramenteiro."

#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for an Empire ware: Fishing Rod, part 2
#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for an Empire ware: Hunting Spear, part 2
#: ../../../../data/tribes/initialization/empire/units.lua:430
#: ../../../../data/tribes/initialization/empire/units.lua:443
msgctxt "empire_ware"
msgid "They are produced by the toolsmith."
msgstr "Elas são produzidas pelo ferramenteiro."

#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for an Empire ware: Scythe, part 2
#: ../../../../data/tribes/initialization/empire/units.lua:456
msgctxt "empire_ware"
msgid "Scythes are produced by the toolsmith."
msgstr "As foices são produzidas pelo ferramenteiro."

#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for an Empire ware: Bread Paddle, part 2
#: ../../../../data/tribes/initialization/empire/units.lua:469
msgctxt "empire_ware"
msgid "Bread paddles are produced by the toolsmith."
msgstr "As pás de pão são produzidas pelo ferramenteiro."

#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for an Empire ware: Basket
#: ../../../../data/tribes/initialization/empire/units.lua:479
msgctxt "empire_ware"
msgid ""
"This basket is needed by the vine farmer for harvesting the grapes. It is "
"produced by the toolsmith."
msgstr "Esta cesta é necessária ao cultivador de vinhas para colher as uvas. Ela é produzida pelo ferramenteiro."

#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for an Empire ware: Kitchen Tools
#: ../../../../data/tribes/initialization/empire/units.lua:488
msgctxt "empire_ware"
msgid ""
"Kitchen tools are needed for preparing rations and meals. They are produced "
"in a toolsmithy and used in taverns and inns."
msgstr "Utensílios de cozinha são necessários para preparar rações e refeições. Eles são produzidos em uma ferraria de ferramentas e usados em tabernas e estalagens."

#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for an Empire ware: Fire Tongs, part 2
#: ../../../../data/tribes/initialization/empire/units.lua:500
msgctxt "empire_ware"
msgid "They are used in the smelting works and produced by the toolsmith."
msgstr "Elas são usadas na fundição e produzidas pelo ferramenteiro."

#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for an Empire ware: Wooden Spear
#: ../../../../data/tribes/initialization/empire/units.lua:513
msgctxt "empire_ware"
msgid ""
"This wooden spear is the basic weapon in the Empire military system. It is "
"produced in the weapon smithy. In combination with a helmet, it is the "
"equipment to fit out young soldiers."
msgstr "Esta lança de madeira é a arma básica no sistema militar do Império. É produzida na ferraria de armas. Em combinação com um elmo, é o equipamento para equipar jovens soldados."

#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for an Empire ware: Spear
#: ../../../../data/tribes/initialization/empire/units.lua:522
msgctxt "empire_ware"
msgid ""
"This spear has an iron spike. It is produced in a weapon smithy and used in "
"a training camp – together with food – to train soldiers from attack level 0"
" to attack level 1."
msgstr "Esta lança tem uma ponta de ferro. É produzida em uma ferraria de armas e usada em um acampamento de treinamento – junto com comida – para treinar soldados do nível de ataque 0 para o nível de ataque 1."

#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for an Empire ware: Advanced Spear
#: ../../../../data/tribes/initialization/empire/units.lua:531
msgctxt "empire_ware"
msgid ""
"This is an advanced spear with a steel tip. It is produced in a weapon "
"smithy and used in a training camp – together with food – to train soldiers "
"from attack level 1 to level 2."
msgstr "Esta é uma lança avançada com ponta de aço. É produzida em uma ferraria de armas e usada em um acampamento de treinamento – junto com comida – para treinar soldados do nível de ataque 1 para o nível 2."

#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for an Empire ware: Heavy Spear
#: ../../../../data/tribes/initialization/empire/units.lua:540
msgctxt "empire_ware"
msgid ""
"This is a strong spear with a steel-tip and a little blade. It is produced "
"in the weapon smithy and used in the training camp – together with food – "
"train soldiers from attack level 2 to level 3."
msgstr "Esta é uma lança forte com ponta de aço e uma pequena lâmina. É produzida na ferraria de armas e usada no acampamento de treinamento – junto com comida – para treinar soldados do nível de ataque 2 para o nível 3."

#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for an Empire ware: War Spear
#: ../../../../data/tribes/initialization/empire/units.lua:549
msgctxt "empire_ware"
msgid ""
"This is the best and sharpest weapon the Empire weaponsmith creates for the "
"soldiers. It is used in the training camp – together with food – to train "
"soldiers from attack level 3 to level 4."
msgstr "Esta é a melhor e mais afiada arma que o ferreiro de armas do Império cria para os soldados. É usada no acampamento de treinamento – junto com comida – para treinar soldados do nível de ataque 3 para o nível 4."

#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for an Empire ware: Helmet
#: ../../../../data/tribes/initialization/empire/units.lua:558
msgctxt "empire_ware"
msgid ""
"The helmet is the basic defense of a soldier. It is produced in an armor "
"smithy. In combination with a wooden spear, it is the equipment to fit out "
"young soldiers. Helmets are also used in training camps – together with food"
" – to train soldiers from health level 0 to level 1."
msgstr "O elmo é a defesa básica de um soldado. É produzido em uma ferraria de armaduras. Em combinação com uma lança de madeira, é o equipamento para equipar jovens soldados. Elmos também são usados em acampamentos de treinamento – junto com comida – para treinar soldados do nível de vida 0 para o nível 1."

#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for an Empire ware: Armor
#: ../../../../data/tribes/initialization/empire/units.lua:567
msgctxt "empire_ware"
msgid ""
"Basic armor for Empire soldiers. It is produced in the armor smithy and used"
" in the training camp – together with food – to train soldiers from health "
"level 1 to level 2."
msgstr "Armadura básica para soldados do Império. É produzida na ferraria de armaduras e usada no acampamento de treinamento – junto com comida – para treinar soldados do nível de vida 1 para o nível 2."

#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for an Empire ware: Chain Armor
#: ../../../../data/tribes/initialization/empire/units.lua:576
msgctxt "empire_ware"
msgid ""
"The chain armor is a medium armor for Empire soldiers. It is produced in an "
"armor smithy and used in a training camp – together with food – to train "
"soldiers from health level 2 to level 3."
msgstr "A armadura de malha é uma armadura média para soldados do Império. É produzida em uma ferraria de armaduras e usada em um acampamento de treinamento – junto com comida – para treinar soldados do nível de vida 2 para o nível 3."

#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for an Empire ware: Gilded Armor
#: ../../../../data/tribes/initialization/empire/units.lua:585
msgctxt "empire_ware"
msgid ""
"The gilded armor is the strongest armor an Empire soldier can have. It is "
"produced in the armor smithy and used in the training camp – together with "
"food – to train soldiers from health level 3 to level 4."
msgstr "A armadura dourada é a armadura mais forte que um soldado do Império pode ter. É produzida na ferraria de armaduras e usada no acampamento de treinamento – junto com comida – para treinar soldados do nível de vida 3 para o nível 4."

#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for an Empire worker: Carrier
#: ../../../../data/tribes/initialization/empire/units.lua:600
msgctxt "empire_worker"
msgid "Carries items along your roads."
msgstr "Transporta itens pelas estradas."

#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for an Empire worker: Ferry
#: ../../../../data/tribes/initialization/empire/units.lua:607
msgctxt "empire_worker"
msgid "Ships wares across narrow rivers."
msgstr "Transporta mercadorias através de rios estreitos."

#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for an Empire worker: Donkey
#: ../../../../data/tribes/initialization/empire/units.lua:616
msgctxt "empire_worker"
msgid ""
"Donkeys help to carry items along busy roads. They are reared in a donkey "
"farm."
msgstr "Jumentos ajudam a carregar itens ao longo de estradas movimentadas. Eles são criados em uma fazenda de jumentos."

#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for an Empire worker: Donkey Breeder
#: ../../../../data/tribes/initialization/empire/units.lua:623
msgctxt "empire_worker"
msgid ""
"Breeds cute and helpful donkeys for adding them to the transportation "
"system."
msgstr "Cria jumentos fofos e prestativos para adicioná-los ao sistema de transporte."

#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for an Empire worker: Stonemason
#: ../../../../data/tribes/initialization/empire/units.lua:633
msgctxt "empire_worker"
msgid "Cuts blocks of granite and marble out of rocks in the vicinity."
msgstr "Corta blocos de granito e mármore das rochas nas proximidades."

#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for an Empire worker: Carpenter
#: ../../../../data/tribes/initialization/empire/units.lua:640
msgctxt "empire_worker"
msgid "Works in the sawmill."
msgstr "Trabalha na serraria."

#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for an Empire worker: Lumberjack
#: ../../../../data/tribes/initialization/empire/units.lua:647
msgctxt "empire_worker"
msgid "Fells trees."
msgstr "Derruba árvores."

#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for an Empire worker: Forester
#: ../../../../data/tribes/initialization/empire/units.lua:654
msgctxt "empire_worker"
msgid "Plants trees."
msgstr "Planta árvores."

#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for an Empire worker: Builder
#: ../../../../data/tribes/initialization/empire/units.lua:661
msgctxt "empire_worker"
msgid "Works at construction sites to raise new buildings."
msgstr "Trabalha nas áreas de cosntrução para criar um novo edifício."

#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for an Empire worker: Shepherd
#: ../../../../data/tribes/initialization/empire/units.lua:668
msgctxt "empire_worker"
msgid "Keeping sheep."
msgstr "Cria ovelhas."

#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for an Empire worker: Weaver
#: ../../../../data/tribes/initialization/empire/units.lua:675
msgctxt "empire_worker"
msgid "Produces cloth for ships and soldiers."
msgstr "Produz tecido para navios e soldados."

#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for an Empire worker: Shipwright
#: ../../../../data/tribes/initialization/empire/units.lua:682
msgctxt "empire_worker"
msgid "Works at the shipyard and constructs new ships."
msgstr "Trabalha no Estaleiro naval onde constrói as novas embarcações"

#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for an Empire worker: Fisher
#: ../../../../data/tribes/initialization/empire/units.lua:692
msgctxt "empire_worker"
msgid "Catches fish in the sea."
msgstr "Captura peixes no mar."

#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for an Empire worker: Hunter
#: ../../../../data/tribes/initialization/empire/units.lua:699
msgctxt "empire_worker"
msgid "The hunter brings fresh, raw meat to the colonists."
msgstr "O Caçador traz boa carne para os colonos."

#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for an Empire worker: Farmer
#: ../../../../data/tribes/initialization/empire/units.lua:706
msgctxt "empire_worker"
msgid "Plants fields."
msgstr "Planta campos."

#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for an Empire worker: Miller
#: ../../../../data/tribes/initialization/empire/units.lua:713
msgctxt "empire_worker"
msgid "Grinds wheat to produce flour."
msgstr "Mói trigo para produzir farinha."

#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for an Empire worker: Baker
#: ../../../../data/tribes/initialization/empire/units.lua:720
msgctxt "empire_worker"
msgid "Bakes bread for workers."
msgstr "Assa pães para os trabalhadores."

#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for an Empire worker: Brewer
#: ../../../../data/tribes/initialization/empire/units.lua:727
msgctxt "empire_worker"
msgid "Produces beer."
msgstr "Produz cerveja."

#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for an Empire worker: Vine Farmer
#: ../../../../data/tribes/initialization/empire/units.lua:734
msgctxt "empire_worker"
msgid "Grows grapevines."
msgstr "Cultiva videiras."

#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for an Empire worker: Vintner
#: ../../../../data/tribes/initialization/empire/units.lua:741
msgctxt "empire_worker"
msgid "Produces wine."
msgstr "Produz vinho."

#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for an Empire worker: Pig Breeder
#: ../../../../data/tribes/initialization/empire/units.lua:748
msgctxt "empire_worker"
msgid "Breeds pigs."
msgstr "Cria porcos."

#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for an Empire worker: Innkeeper
#: ../../../../data/tribes/initialization/empire/units.lua:755
msgctxt "empire_worker"
msgid "Produces food for miners."
msgstr "Produz comida para os mineradores."

#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for an Empire worker: Geologist
#: ../../../../data/tribes/initialization/empire/units.lua:765
msgctxt "empire_worker"
msgid "Discovers resources for mining."
msgstr "Descobre recursos para mineração."

#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for an Empire worker: Miner
#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for an Empire worker: Master Miner
#: ../../../../data/tribes/initialization/empire/units.lua:772
#: ../../../../data/tribes/initialization/empire/units.lua:779
msgctxt "empire_worker"
msgid "Works deep in the mines to obtain coal, iron, gold or marble."
msgstr "Trabalha no fundo das minas para obter carvão, ferro, ouro ou mármore."

#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for an Empire worker: Charcoal Burner
#: ../../../../data/tribes/initialization/empire/units.lua:786
msgctxt "empire_worker"
msgid "Burns coal."
msgstr "Queima carvão."

#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for an Empire worker: Smelter
#: ../../../../data/tribes/initialization/empire/units.lua:793
msgctxt "empire_worker"
msgid "Smelts ores into metal."
msgstr "Funde minérios em metal."

#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for an Empire worker: Toolsmith
#: ../../../../data/tribes/initialization/empire/units.lua:803
msgctxt "empire_worker"
msgid "Produces tools for the workers."
msgstr "Produz ferramentas para os trabalhadores."

#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for an Empire worker: Recruit
#: ../../../../data/tribes/initialization/empire/units.lua:813
msgctxt "empire_worker"
msgid "Eager to become a soldier and defend his tribe!"
msgstr "Ansioso para se tornar um soldado e defender sua tribo!"

#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for an Empire worker: Soldier
#: ../../../../data/tribes/initialization/empire/units.lua:822
msgctxt "empire_worker"
msgid "Defend and Conquer!"
msgstr "Defender e Conquistar!"

#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for an Empire worker: Trainer
#: ../../../../data/tribes/initialization/empire/units.lua:829
msgctxt "empire_worker"
msgid "Trains the soldiers."
msgstr "Treina os soldados"

#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for an Empire worker: Weaponsmith
#: ../../../../data/tribes/initialization/empire/units.lua:836
msgctxt "empire_worker"
msgid "Produces weapons for the soldiers."
msgstr "Produzir armas para os soldados."

#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for an Empire worker: Armorsmith
#: ../../../../data/tribes/initialization/empire/units.lua:843
msgctxt "empire_worker"
msgid "Produces armor for the soldiers."
msgstr "Produz armaduras para os soldados."

#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for an Empire worker: Scout
#: ../../../../data/tribes/initialization/empire/units.lua:850
msgctxt "empire_worker"
msgid ""
"Scouts like Scotty the scout scouting unscouted areas in a scouty fashion."
msgstr "O escoteiro explora áreas inexploradas a sua volta."

#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for an Empire immovable: Grapevine
#: ../../../../data/tribes/initialization/empire/units.lua:911
msgid "This grapevine has just been planted."
msgstr "Esta videira acabou de ser plantada."

#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for an Empire immovable: Grapevine
#: ../../../../data/tribes/initialization/empire/units.lua:918
#: ../../../../data/tribes/initialization/empire/units.lua:925
msgid "This grapevine is growing."
msgstr "Esta videira está crescendo."

#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for an Empire immovable: Grapevine
#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for an Empire immovable usable by Frisians: Grapevine
#: ../../../../data/tribes/initialization/empire/units.lua:932
#: ../../../../data/tribes/initialization/frisians/units.lua:1423
msgid "This grapevine is ready for harvesting."
msgstr "Esta videira está pronta para a colheita."

#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for an Empire resource indicator: Stones, part 1
#: ../../../../data/tribes/initialization/empire/units.lua:987
#: ../../../../data/tribes/initialization/empire/units.lua:1031
msgid ""
"Marble is a basic building material and can be dug up by a marble mine. You "
"will also get granite from the mine."
msgstr "Mármore é um material de construção básico e pode ser extraído por uma mina de mármore. Você também obterá granito da mina."

#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for an Empire resource indicator: Stones, part 2
#: ../../../../data/tribes/initialization/empire/units.lua:989
msgid "There is only a little bit of marble here."
msgstr "Há apenas um pouco de mármore aqui."

#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for an Empire resource indicator: Stones, part 2
#: ../../../../data/tribes/initialization/empire/units.lua:1033
msgid "There is a lot of marble here."
msgstr "Há muito mármore aqui."

#. TRANSLATORS: DO NOT TRANSLATE, but you may transliterate into non-latin
#. fonts.
#. Adaptation of a classical Latin quote meaning:
#. "All roads lead to Fremil."
#: ../../../../data/tribes/initialization/empire/units.lua:1148
msgid "Omnes viæ ducunt Fremilem."
msgstr "Omnes viæ ducunt Fremilem."

#. TRANSLATORS: Lore helptext for an Empire warehouse: Headquarters
#. Translation for the adapted classical Latin quote:
#. "Omnes viæ ducunt Fremilem."
#: ../../../../data/tribes/initialization/empire/units.lua:1152
msgid "All roads lead to Fremil."
msgstr "Todas as estradas levam a Fremil."

#. TRANSLATORS: Lore author helptext for an Empire warehouse: Headquarters
#: ../../../../data/tribes/initialization/empire/units.lua:1156
msgctxt "empire_building"
msgid "Proverb signifying the glory of the Empire and its capital"
msgstr "Provérbio que significa a glória do Império e de sua capital"

#. TRANSLATORS: Purpose helptext for an Empire warehouse: Headquarters
#: ../../../../data/tribes/initialization/empire/units.lua:1159
msgctxt "empire_building"
msgid "Accommodation for your people. Also stores your wares and tools."
msgstr "Acomodação para o seu povo. Também armazena suas mercadorias e ferramentas."

#. TRANSLATORS: Note helptext for an Empire warehouse: Headquarters
#: ../../../../data/tribes/initialization/empire/units.lua:1161
msgctxt "empire_building"
msgid "The headquarters is your main building."
msgstr "O quartel-general é sua construção principal."

#. TRANSLATORS: DO NOT TRANSLATE, but you may transliterate into non-latin
#. fonts.
#. Classical Latin quote meaning:
#. "A shipwreck that is common to all is a consolation."
#: ../../../../data/tribes/initialization/empire/units.lua:1171
msgid "Commune naufragium omnibus est consolatio."
msgstr "Commune naufragium omnibus est consolatio."

#. TRANSLATORS: Lore helptext for an Empire warehouse: Headquarters Shipwreck
#. Translation for the classical Latin quote:
#. "Commune naufragium omnibus est consolatio."
#: ../../../../data/tribes/initialization/empire/units.lua:1175
msgid "A shipwreck that is common to all is a consolation."
msgstr "Um naufrágio comum a todos é um consolo."

#. TRANSLATORS: Lore author helptext for an Empire warehouse: Headquarters
#. Shipwreck
#: ../../../../data/tribes/initialization/empire/units.lua:1178
msgctxt "empire_building"
msgid "Lutius after stranding on an uncharted island"
msgstr "Lutius após encalhar em uma ilha desconhecida"

#. TRANSLATORS: Purpose helptext for an Empire warehouse: Headquarters
#. Shipwreck
#: ../../../../data/tribes/initialization/empire/units.lua:1180
msgctxt "empire_building"
msgid ""
"Although this ship ran aground, it still serves as accommodation for your "
"people. It also stores your wares and tools."
msgstr "Embora este navio tenha encalhado, ele ainda serve de acomodação para o seu povo. Também armazena suas mercadorias e ferramentas."

#. TRANSLATORS: Note helptext for an Empire warehouse: Headquarters Shipwreck
#: ../../../../data/tribes/initialization/empire/units.lua:1182
msgctxt "empire_building"
msgid "The headquarters shipwreck is your main building."
msgstr "O naufrágio do quartel-general é sua construção principal."

#. TRANSLATORS: DO NOT TRANSLATE, but you may transliterate into non-latin
#. fonts.
#. Classical Latin quote meaning:
#. "Who gives promptly, gives twice, who gives late, gives nothing."
#: ../../../../data/tribes/initialization/empire/units.lua:1192
msgid "Bis dat, qui cito dat, nil dat, qui munera tardat."
msgstr "Bis dat, qui cito dat, nil dat, qui munera tardat."

#. TRANSLATORS: Lore helptext for an Empire warehouse: Warehouse
#. Translation for the classical Latin quote:
#. "Bis dat, qui cito dat, nil dat, qui munera tardat."
#: ../../../../data/tribes/initialization/empire/units.lua:1196
msgid "Who gives promptly, gives twice, who gives late, gives nothing."
msgstr "Quem dá prontamente, dá duas vezes; quem dá tarde, não dá nada."

#. TRANSLATORS: Lore author helptext for an Empire warehouse: Warehouse
#: ../../../../data/tribes/initialization/empire/units.lua:1199
msgctxt "empire_building"
msgid "Proverb written over the doors of a warehouse"
msgstr "Provérbio escrito sobre as portas de um armazém"

#. TRANSLATORS: Purpose helptext for an Empire warehouse: Warehouse
#: ../../../../data/tribes/initialization/empire/units.lua:1201
msgctxt "empire_building"
msgid ""
"Your workers and soldiers will find shelter here. Also stores your wares and"
" tools."
msgstr "Seus trabalhadores e soldados encontrarão abrigo aqui. Também armazena suas mercadorias e ferramentas."

#. TRANSLATORS: DO NOT TRANSLATE, but you may transliterate into non-latin
#. fonts.
#. Classical Latin quote meaning:
#. "To sail is necessary."
#: ../../../../data/tribes/initialization/empire/units.lua:1211
msgid "Navigare necesse est."
msgstr "Navigare necesse est."

#. TRANSLATORS: Lore helptext for an Empire warehouse: Port
#. Translation for the classical Latin quote:
#. "Navigare necesse est."
#: ../../../../data/tribes/initialization/empire/units.lua:1215
msgid "To sail is necessary."
msgstr "Navegar é necessário."

#. TRANSLATORS: Lore author helptext for an Empire warehouse: Port
#: ../../../../data/tribes/initialization/empire/units.lua:1219
msgctxt "empire_building"
msgid ""
"Admiral Litus Marius Exsiccatus, sending out the fleet to break the naval "
"blockade during the First Atlantean War"
msgstr "Almirante Litus Marius Exsiccatus, enviando a frota para romper o bloqueio naval durante a Primeira Guerra Atlante"

#. TRANSLATORS: Purpose helptext for an Empire warehouse: Port
#: ../../../../data/tribes/initialization/empire/units.lua:1223
msgctxt "empire_building"
msgid ""
"Serves as a base for overseas colonization and trade. Also stores your "
"soldiers, wares and tools."
msgstr "Serve como base para colonização e comércio além-mar. Também armazena seus soldados, mercadorias e ferramentas."

#. TRANSLATORS: Note helptext for an Empire warehouse: Port
#: ../../../../data/tribes/initialization/empire/units.lua:1225
msgctxt "empire_building"
msgid ""
"Similar to the Headquarters a Port can be attacked and destroyed by an "
"enemy. It is recommendable to send soldiers to defend it."
msgstr "Semelhante ao quartel-general, um porto pode ser atacado e destruído por um inimigo. É recomendável enviar soldados para defendê-lo."

#. TRANSLATORS: DO NOT TRANSLATE, but you may transliterate into non-latin
#. fonts.
#. Classical Latin quote meaning:
#. "Good contracts make good friends."
#: ../../../../data/tribes/initialization/empire/units.lua:1237
msgid "Clara pacta, boni amici."
msgstr "Clara pacta, boni amici."

#. TRANSLATORS: Lore helptext for an Empire market: Market
#. Translation for the classical Latin quote:
#. "Clara pacta, boni amici."
#: ../../../../data/tribes/initialization/empire/units.lua:1241
msgid "Good contracts make good friends."
msgstr "Bons contratos fazem bons amigos."

#. TRANSLATORS: Purpose helptext for an Empire market: Market
#: ../../../../data/tribes/initialization/empire/units.lua:1244
msgctxt "empire_building"
msgid "A market enables trading with other tribes."
msgstr "Um mercado permite comércio com outras tribos."

#. TRANSLATORS: DO NOT TRANSLATE, but you may transliterate into non-latin
#. fonts.
#. Classical Latin quote meaning:
#. "There shall not be left here a stone upon a stone that shall not be
#. destroyed."
#: ../../../../data/tribes/initialization/empire/units.lua:1256
msgid "Non relinquetur hic lapis super lapidem qui non destruatur."
msgstr "Non relinquetur hic lapis super lapidem qui non destruatur."

#. TRANSLATORS: Lore helptext for an Empire production site: Quarry
#. Translation for the classical Latin quote:
#. "Non relinquetur hic lapis super lapidem qui non destruatur."
#: ../../../../data/tribes/initialization/empire/units.lua:1260
msgid ""
"There shall not be left here a stone upon a stone that shall not be "
"destroyed."
msgstr "Não ficará aqui pedra sobre pedra que não seja destruída."

#. TRANSLATORS: Lore author helptext for an Empire production site: Quarry
#: ../../../../data/tribes/initialization/empire/units.lua:1263
msgctxt "empire_building"
msgid "An enthusiastic stonemason arriving to a new quarry"
msgstr "Um pedreiro entusiasmado chegando a uma nova pedreira"

#. TRANSLATORS: Purpose helptext for an Empire production site: Quarry
#: ../../../../data/tribes/initialization/empire/units.lua:1265
msgctxt "empire_building"
msgid "Cuts blocks of granite and marble out of rocks in the vicinity."
msgstr "Corta blocos de granito e mármore das rochas nas proximidades."

#. TRANSLATORS: Note helptext for an Empire production site: Quarry, part 1
#: ../../../../data/tribes/initialization/empire/units.lua:1268
msgctxt "empire_building"
msgid "The quarry needs rocks to cut within the work area."
msgstr "A pedreira precisa de rochas para cortar dentro da área de trabalho."

#. TRANSLATORS: Note helptext for an Empire production site: Quarry, part 2
#: ../../../../data/tribes/initialization/empire/units.lua:1270
msgctxt "empire_building"
msgid ""
"The stonemason finds 5 blocks of granite and 2 blocks of marble out of 7 "
"rocks."
msgstr "O pedreiro encontra 5 blocos de granito e 2 blocos de mármore a cada 7 rochas."

#. TRANSLATORS: Performance helptext for an Empire production site: Quarry,
#. part 1
#: ../../../../data/tribes/initialization/empire/units.lua:1274
msgctxt "empire_building"
msgid ""
"This building can produce one granite between %1$s and %2$s and one marble "
"between %3$s and %4$s, depending on how far the stonemason has to walk."
msgstr "Esta construção pode produzir um granito entre %1$s e %2$s e um mármore entre %3$s e %4$s, dependendo de quão longe o pedreiro tem que andar."

#. TRANSLATORS: Performance helptext for an Empire production site: Quarry,
#. part 2
#. TRANSLATORS: Performance helptext for an Empire production site:
#. Lumberjack's House
#. TRANSLATORS: Performance helptext for an Empire production site: Forester's
#. House, part 2
#. TRANSLATORS: Performance helptext for an Empire production site: Fisher's
#. House, part 2
#. TRANSLATORS: Performance helptext for an Empire production site: Hunter's
#. House, part 2
#. TRANSLATORS: Performance helptext for an Empire production site: Scout's
#. House, part 2
#. TRANSLATORS: Performance helptext for an Empire production site: Ferry
#. Yard, part 2
#. TRANSLATORS: Performance helptext for an Empire production site: Shipyard,
#. part 2
#: ../../../../data/tribes/initialization/empire/units.lua:1276
#: ../../../../data/tribes/initialization/empire/units.lua:1303
#: ../../../../data/tribes/initialization/empire/units.lua:1330
#: ../../../../data/tribes/initialization/empire/units.lua:1361
#: ../../../../data/tribes/initialization/empire/units.lua:1388
#: ../../../../data/tribes/initialization/empire/units.lua:1439
#: ../../../../data/tribes/initialization/empire/units.lua:2369
#: ../../../../data/tribes/initialization/empire/units.lua:2402
msgctxt "empire_building"
msgid "In case of slopes or obstacles in the way, the time is increased."
msgstr "Em caso de encostas ou obstáculos no caminho, o tempo é aumentado."

#. TRANSLATORS: DO NOT TRANSLATE, but you may transliterate into non-latin
#. fonts.
#. Classical Latin quote meaning:
#. "Don’t carry logs to the forest."
#: ../../../../data/tribes/initialization/empire/units.lua:1287
msgid "In silvam non ligna feras."
msgstr "In silvam non ligna feras."

#. TRANSLATORS: Lore helptext for an Empire production site: Lumberjack's
#. House
#. Translation for the classical Latin quote:
#. "In silvam non ligna feras."
#: ../../../../data/tribes/initialization/empire/units.lua:1291
msgid "Don’t carry logs to the forest."
msgstr "Não leve toras para a floresta."

#. TRANSLATORS: Lore author helptext for an Empire production site:
#. Lumberjack's House
#: ../../../../data/tribes/initialization/empire/units.lua:1294
msgctxt "empire_building"
msgid "A carrier to a lumberjack who lost his way home"
msgstr "Um carregador para um lenhador que perdeu o caminho de casa"

#. TRANSLATORS: Note helptext for an Empire production site: Lumberjack's
#. House
#: ../../../../data/tribes/initialization/empire/units.lua:1298
msgctxt "empire_building"
msgid "The lumberjack’s house needs trees to fell within the work area."
msgstr "A casa de lenhador precisa de árvores para derrubar dentro da área de trabalho."

#. TRANSLATORS: Performance helptext for an Empire production site:
#. Lumberjack's House
#: ../../../../data/tribes/initialization/empire/units.lua:1301
msgctxt "empire_building"
msgid ""
"This building can produce one log between %1$s and %2$s, depending on how "
"far the lumberjack has to walk."
msgstr "Esta construção pode produzir uma tora entre %1$s e %2$s, dependendo de quão longe o lenhador tem que andar."

#. TRANSLATORS: DO NOT TRANSLATE, but you may transliterate into non-latin
#. fonts.
#. Classical Latin quote meaning:
#. "Live, grow, and bloom!"
#: ../../../../data/tribes/initialization/empire/units.lua:1314
msgid "Vivat, crescat, floreat!"
msgstr "Vivat, crescat, floreat!"

#. TRANSLATORS: Lore helptext for an Empire production site: Forester's House
#. Translation for the classical Latin quote:
#. "Vivat, crescat, floreat!"
#: ../../../../data/tribes/initialization/empire/units.lua:1318
msgid "Live, grow, and bloom!"
msgstr "Viva, cresça e floresça!"

#. TRANSLATORS: Lore author helptext for an Empire production site: Forester's
#. House
